    "name": "JFrog Artifactory Query Language (AQL) AQL Search Build Promotion API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Advanced search API using Artifactory Query Language (AQL), a SQL-like query language for finding and filtering artifacts, builds, and entries in JFrog Artifactory. AQL provides powerful querying capabilities including domain queries, field filtering, sorting, limiting, and inclusion of related entities.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: JFrog Support\n Email: support@jfrog.com",
      "type": "text/plain"
